+# The installed OMP release, measured, is the same 2025-era revision as upstream
+
+PLACEHOLDER ENTRY — round-65 C2 landing dry-run. Body text is the staged
+`merge/kumitate/` skew entry, re-pointed at rows S201-S203; the real entry
+replaces this section with quotes from the captures and the host-measurement
+bullets from `scripts/omp-binary-probe.sh`.
+
+## The pair
+
+| side | what it says | measurement |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| upstream `main` | `MCP_PROTOCOL_VERSION = "2025-11-25"` | row S201 at the release commit (upstream `main` was the same commit) |
+| the installed binary | the same protocol literals | the byte sweep of the release binary (S203 and the probe below) |
+
+Both sides are on the same revision. The installed release is not behind
+upstream; the protocol revision it implements is the one the specification
+has since replaced.
+
+## What this entry does not claim
+
+It does not claim the installed release is broken, and it does not claim the
+upstream constant is wrong. It records the pair as measured.
